    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0643" n="385" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg385"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.857L97/4a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 8, 1915, noon</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1639. Please secure and cable as soon as possible the German Government’s report
                    on the sinking of the <hi rendition="#italic">Lusitania.</hi> Latest reports
                    estimate loss of life at more than one thousand, many of them being
                    Americans.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
